name almendra
category Package
revision 56035
shortdesc Almendra fonts with LaTeX support
longdesc This package provides LaTeX, pdfLaTeX, XeLaTeX, and LuaLaTeX
longdesc support for the Almendra family of fonts, designed by Ana
longdesc Sanfelippo. Almendra is a typeface design based on calligraphy.
longdesc Its style is related to the chancery and gothic hands. There
longdesc are regular and bold weights with matching italics. There is
longdesc also a regular-weight small-caps.
execute addMap almendra.map
